    <briefdescription>
<para>Audio reader that decodes MP3, OGG, FLAC and other formats by shelling out to the <computeroutput>ffmpeg</computeroutput> binary. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The binary must be on PATH. Output is always resampled to 16 kHz mono float32 PCM.</para>
<para>Security: the file path is shell-escaped before being passed to the subprocess. Files whose path contains characters that cannot be safely escaped are rejected with std::runtime_error.</para>
<para>If <computeroutput>ffmpeg</computeroutput> is not found on PATH, <ref refid="classthemis_1_1whisper_1_1_ffmpeg_audio_chunk_reader_1af57e8022f23e4222cfa2aa90156c98b3" kindref="member">readFile()</ref> throws std::runtime_error(&quot;ffmpeg not available&quot;). </para>
    </detaileddescription>
